WEBVTT

00:08.760 --> 00:09.900
Syo-chan.

00:11.390 --> 00:12.680
Guys.

00:12.680 --> 00:16.620
It's not fair for you
to watch the sunrise alone.

00:18.930 --> 00:19.910
You caught me.

00:20.620 --> 00:22.000
It's nearly time.

00:22.000 --> 00:22.830
Yeah.

00:23.290 --> 00:24.650
I'm all fired up.

02:53.490 --> 02:55.690
Today, we've come to the National Arena

02:55.690 --> 03:00.060
where the Triple S decisive concert will be held.

03:00.530 --> 03:06.390
The Triple S decisive concert features
QUARTET NIGHT, STARISH, and HEAVENS.

03:06.390 --> 03:09.550
How will the concert end?

03:09.550 --> 03:15.040
Many fans have come to the arena
to witness the miraculous event.

03:16.050 --> 03:17.420
STARISH is arriving.

03:23.490 --> 03:24.850
Nanami.

03:28.020 --> 03:30.020
QUARTET NIGHT is arriving.

03:52.930 --> 03:54.500
G-Guys...

03:54.500 --> 03:57.540
The time has come to settle this.

03:58.410 --> 04:04.220
Between the three groups of
QUARTET NIGHT, STARISH, and HEAVENS.

04:04.220 --> 04:06.300
Yeah, the three groups.

04:14.730 --> 04:15.980
STARISH
Anteroom

04:18.910 --> 04:20.570
It's starting soon.

04:23.130 --> 04:26.530
I always get nervous before concerts.

04:26.530 --> 04:30.620
Yeah. I'm really fired up,
but I can never get used to this.

04:30.620 --> 04:34.460
It means concerts
have that special something.

04:34.460 --> 04:39.000
We've worked hard to prepare for this day.

04:39.000 --> 04:41.550
Through our combined efforts...

04:43.700 --> 04:45.570
Let's make this concert a success.

04:45.570 --> 04:46.380
Yeah.

04:48.500 --> 04:54.230
Time has flown by since
the day we requested a do-over.

04:55.440 --> 04:57.780
We've been through a lot of experiences,

04:57.780 --> 05:00.860
but those feelings have been
engraved into our hearts.

05:00.860 --> 05:05.150
The four of us have done everything we can.

05:07.260 --> 05:10.450
We have always sought greater heights.

05:11.830 --> 05:16.080
Let's put all we've experienced and felt
into our songs!

05:17.510 --> 05:19.200
You don't need to tell us.

05:19.200 --> 05:21.140
We always intended to do that.

05:21.140 --> 05:23.560
Isn't that the basis of our bond?

05:25.420 --> 05:26.180
Yeah.

05:27.380 --> 05:30.600
QUARTET NIGHT
Anteroom

05:27.380 --> 05:30.600
QUARTET NIGHT, the performance
will be starting soon.

05:37.650 --> 05:38.520
Let's go.

05:49.430 --> 05:52.770
Everyone, thank you for waiting.

05:53.470 --> 05:55.620
It's finally, finally time.

05:56.340 --> 06:00.660
The decisive concert to determine
who will become the opening artist

06:00.660 --> 06:03.130
of the international sports festival,
Super Star Sports,

06:03.130 --> 06:05.710
or Triple S, for short, will now begin!

06:05.710 --> 06:07.480
During the previous selection concert,

06:07.480 --> 06:09.450
due to the passionate insistence
of the participants,

06:09.450 --> 06:12.050
it was decided that a re-election would be held.

06:12.050 --> 06:17.100
And today, that moment of destiny has arrived.

06:17.100 --> 06:19.440
The climactic concert of the Triple S.

06:19.440 --> 06:22.720
The curtains are now rising
on the concert that all of Japan—

06:22.720 --> 06:24.530
no, the entire world, is watching!

06:29.110 --> 06:34.420
Allow me to introduce the groups
that will be taking the stage.

06:34.420 --> 06:37.660
First up is this group.

06:39.120 --> 06:41.690
These four beautifully
glowing bolts of lightning

06:41.690 --> 06:42.980
traveled across the country,

06:42.980 --> 06:47.590
their sensational voices
splendidly ringing out across all regions.

06:47.590 --> 06:52.660
With each member possessing his own
unique brilliance, their light is perfect.

06:52.660 --> 06:55.080
What kind of excitement
will those bolts of lightning

06:55.080 --> 06:58.240
that connect heaven
and earth bring to us today?

07:06.150 --> 07:09.290
QUARTET NIGHT!

07:16.000 --> 07:17.120
Next up...

07:18.220 --> 07:23.080
"We'll always watch over you."
You can practically hear them saying it.

07:23.080 --> 07:25.920
They are a seven-colored prism
spread across the sky.

07:25.920 --> 07:29.630
Their multicolored beams of light
are an arch supporting each other.

07:29.950 --> 07:32.600
Using their strong bonds as a rainbow bridge,

07:32.600 --> 07:37.890
they come to us splendidly,
powerfully, and brilliantly.

07:37.890 --> 07:40.270
STARISH!

08:05.590 --> 08:13.000
HEAVENS! HEAVENS! HEAVENS!

08:10.050 --> 08:13.020
I have an announcement to make.

08:13.020 --> 08:15.120
Raging Entertainment's HEAVENS,

08:15.120 --> 08:17.600
who was scheduled to perform today,

08:17.600 --> 08:19.850
has dropped out

08:21.030 --> 08:22.390
of the decisive concert.

08:30.840 --> 08:33.450
Quiet. Quiet, please.

08:33.450 --> 08:36.200
No way! This can't be happening!

08:42.050 --> 08:46.500
After realizing my strength, they lost hope.

08:47.260 --> 08:50.070
Despair breaks people.

08:51.490 --> 08:55.330
I repeat, HEAVENS has withdrawn
from the concert.

08:55.330 --> 09:00.720
The decisive concert will be held
with QUARTET NIGHT and STARISH only.

09:00.720 --> 09:19.030
HEAVENS! HEAVENS! HEAVENS!

09:05.980 --> 09:08.230
I can't believe a group dropped out.

09:08.230 --> 09:10.080
This isn't a decisive concert at all.

09:10.080 --> 09:12.920
This could hurt the image of the Triple S.

09:12.920 --> 09:15.530
Shouldn't we hold a new concert
with new candidates?

09:17.740 --> 09:19.030
Can I speak for a minute?

09:20.560 --> 09:24.550
The decisive concert is meaningless unless

09:24.550 --> 09:28.120
QUARTET NIGHT, STARISH, <i>and</i> HEAVENS are here.

09:28.910 --> 09:33.070
After all, that's why
we requested a re-election.

09:33.630 --> 09:35.030
Kotobuki-san.

09:35.600 --> 09:41.810
We want to face HEAVENS and STARISH
with our passion for music in our hearts.

09:43.290 --> 09:45.680
We came this far with that desire in mind.

09:45.990 --> 09:51.690
We offer our passion to music
and attempt to exceed perfection.

09:51.690 --> 09:58.490
When we sing our souls and hearts
out with them, we will win.

09:58.490 --> 10:02.450
So we'll wait for HEAVENS as long as it takes.

10:08.160 --> 10:09.880
HEAVENS will come.

10:11.290 --> 10:12.670
They'll definitely come.

10:12.670 --> 10:16.210
It's not like them to drop out.

10:16.640 --> 10:20.780
HEAVENS has a love for music in their hearts.

10:20.780 --> 10:24.150
They'd never give up.

10:24.150 --> 10:28.110
With iron wills, they see
their convictions through.

10:28.110 --> 10:31.520
We're burning with passion, too.

10:31.520 --> 10:34.230
We all believe in them.

10:38.560 --> 10:40.030
You heard them.

10:40.650 --> 10:42.740
But you all feel the same way, too, right?

10:46.960 --> 10:48.180
Idiots.

10:48.850 --> 10:55.200
How foolish and naive of them
to wait for those who will never come.

11:01.800 --> 11:02.640
Good.

11:06.550 --> 11:07.440
Good.

11:08.640 --> 11:10.000
Good.

11:11.330 --> 11:12.900
Good!

11:13.300 --> 11:16.010
Sorry to keep you waiting, angels.

11:20.350 --> 11:22.490
I-It's HEAVENS!

11:23.480 --> 11:27.810
The group thought to have withdrawn
from the concert has appeared!

11:29.540 --> 11:30.830
What?

11:51.830 --> 11:52.920
Withdraw?

11:53.390 --> 11:56.360
You think we would withdraw from a concert?

11:56.360 --> 11:58.890
No, of course not.

12:08.480 --> 12:10.450
Sorry we're late.

12:13.430 --> 12:14.420
Thanks for waiting.

12:15.200 --> 12:17.630
We're here.

12:19.340 --> 12:22.040
Attention, everyone.

12:22.040 --> 12:24.980
The world's cutest boy, Nagi, has arrived.

12:27.820 --> 12:31.730
Let's enjoy this passionate night together.

12:34.350 --> 12:35.850
Let me sing already.

12:38.210 --> 12:44.280
We have opened the path that was closed
to return to you angels.

12:46.280 --> 12:52.040
HEAVENS responds to the voices of angels
with noble hearts burning with passion.

13:01.560 --> 13:10.150
STARISH! STARISH! STARISH!

13:10.150 --> 13:16.710
QUARTET NIGHT! QUARTET NIGHT! QUARTET NIGHT!

13:16.710 --> 13:25.710
HEAVENS! HEAVENS! HEAVENS!

13:25.710 --> 13:27.410
You sure took your time.

13:27.410 --> 13:30.120
But we believed you would come.

13:31.350 --> 13:34.160
The true stars are always fashionably late.

13:34.650 --> 13:36.430
There's no problem at all.

13:39.960 --> 13:43.000
Let's get the greatest night ever started.

13:49.000 --> 13:53.370
Why? HEAVENS was supposed to have lost hope.

13:55.770 --> 14:00.190
Where do you think you're going?

14:02.190 --> 14:04.230
You put HEAVENS up to this.

14:04.230 --> 14:08.450
No, no. I didn't do anything.

14:08.450 --> 14:09.720
I don't believe you.

14:09.720 --> 14:11.330
No matter.

14:11.330 --> 14:16.160
You should watch the decisive
battle between these three groups.

14:17.220 --> 14:22.700
Once the concert starts,
there's nothing we can do.

14:22.700 --> 14:33.100
Whether it starts or finishes, succeeds
or fails all depends on them now.

14:33.680 --> 14:40.940
As a man who once stood on that stage,
you must understand.

14:51.010 --> 14:55.350
Girls in the audience,
are you tired of waiting?

15:04.980 --> 15:08.090
We're about to sing our hearts out.

15:08.090 --> 15:10.260
So listen with all you've got, too.

15:11.120 --> 15:13.430
Our continuously evolving feelings,

15:13.430 --> 15:16.680
we'll deliver to you.

15:16.850 --> 15:19.810
QUARTET NIGHT, "God's Star"!

15:34.950 --> 15:38.680
The mist quickly clears (clears)

15:38.680 --> 15:41.830
Illuminating the dazzling path (illuminating)

15:41.830 --> 15:45.040
We become the wind we must become (become)

15:45.400 --> 15:48.530
And stand dignified like champions

15:48.530 --> 15:52.000
With your fingertips one,
two, bang (one, two, bang)

15:52.000 --> 15:54.760
Whether white or black,
one, two, bang (one, two, bang)

15:54.760 --> 15:58.220
As we sit and wait on our throne

15:58.220 --> 16:03.220
We only acknowledge those who come to us

16:03.220 --> 16:03.850
We sing

16:03.850 --> 16:06.230
With my entire spirit

16:06.230 --> 16:07.170
We sing

16:07.170 --> 16:09.610
From bonds to trust

16:09.610 --> 16:10.540
We sing

16:10.540 --> 16:11.650
Active dreams

16:11.650 --> 16:12.220
We sing

16:12.220 --> 16:13.450
Forever, we sing

16:13.450 --> 16:16.450
Quartet song, quartet beat

16:16.450 --> 16:20.160
Shine and dance our kiss

16:20.160 --> 16:26.840
Release the lightning bolts
in a flashing moment, one light

16:26.840 --> 16:33.800
To that ultimate light
impossible is nothing no, no

16:33.800 --> 16:40.220
I will take only you since
you gave me love and the sky

16:40.670 --> 16:44.780
Love is truth! We don't want a legend,

16:44.780 --> 16:50.230
we should be aiming for God's stars!

17:26.390 --> 17:29.960
That was amazing. I understood
exactly how they feel.

17:29.960 --> 17:32.820
I had no idea they had evolved so much!

17:32.820 --> 17:35.280
Yeah. It's awesome!

17:44.970 --> 17:46.060
That was wonderful.

18:03.070 --> 18:03.950
Kohai-chan.

18:03.950 --> 18:05.270
Yes?

18:10.120 --> 18:11.400
Thank you.

18:13.530 --> 18:14.570
That was amazing!

18:14.890 --> 18:16.110
I want to sing now!

18:18.680 --> 18:20.490
Haruka.

18:20.490 --> 18:22.450
Over here.

18:22.450 --> 18:24.990
You're here to see us, right?

18:24.990 --> 18:26.700
Guys.

18:26.700 --> 18:29.380
Ha-chan, sorry for making you worry.

18:29.810 --> 18:31.880
You can cry in my arms, if you want.

18:31.880 --> 18:33.460
U-Um...

18:33.460 --> 18:35.670
You're bothering Nanami-san.

18:35.670 --> 18:38.380
What? I'm not bothering you, am I?

18:40.460 --> 18:43.140
I'm excited to hear you sing.

18:44.990 --> 18:46.810
It's thanks to your song.

18:46.810 --> 18:47.520
What?

18:48.660 --> 18:53.760
Because of your song, we didn't give up.

18:53.760 --> 18:58.950
When the arena staff and security
guards saw our determination,

18:58.950 --> 19:01.710
they helped us get here.

19:01.710 --> 19:05.870
Our love for and faith in music was on our side.

19:05.870 --> 19:07.340
That's great.

19:08.240 --> 19:10.120
I'm really glad for you.

19:10.470 --> 19:13.880
Sometimes we were so angry,
there was nothing we could do.

19:14.700 --> 19:21.300
But your song led us to the stars again.

19:21.300 --> 19:26.350
Our passion didn't die.
We're here because of you.

19:26.350 --> 19:31.730
It wouldn't make sense for us not to be here
since we're so talented and popular.

19:32.870 --> 19:36.270
We won't lose.

19:37.220 --> 19:38.530
Nanami Haruka.

19:38.530 --> 19:39.560
Yes?

19:39.560 --> 19:41.770
I promise this song we're about to sing

19:41.770 --> 19:45.780
will be greatest performance
we've ever given.

19:45.780 --> 19:48.540
All right. I'm looking forward to it.

19:48.540 --> 19:50.940
And if we win this contest...

19:53.370 --> 19:56.920
This time, you'll become HEAVENS' composer.

19:57.690 --> 19:59.760
Prepare yourself.

20:01.090 --> 20:02.800
"Immortal Inferno".

20:17.860 --> 20:21.690
This impulse can't be stopped

20:21.690 --> 20:25.450
Pure spirit hidden in our hearts

20:25.450 --> 20:29.230
We'll show you true empathy

20:29.230 --> 20:32.410
With the beautiful song
of the wingbeats of elves

20:32.850 --> 20:36.210
To become the only ones
We wander and search

20:36.210 --> 20:43.340
Where is the key to the door of our hearts (where is love)

20:39.840 --> 20:41.670
Strength is not enough

20:41.670 --> 20:43.340
An eye glaring at the world

20:43.340 --> 20:47.010
We won't let anyone get in our way

20:47.010 --> 20:52.850
HEA (they won't) VENS (take the hope)
faith (we seized)

20:53.190 --> 21:00.400
Let these burning emotions become
flames to illuminate the darkness

21:00.400 --> 21:05.320
Hundreds of blooming flowers
bubble over in our place

21:05.320 --> 21:07.780
Let our dreams shine

21:07.780 --> 21:15.080
Do you remember the day we
stole you away to take you to heaven

21:15.080 --> 21:19.750
Sparks of fire scatter and burn tonight

21:20.060 --> 21:24.290
Let's keep this immortal inferno burning hot

21:58.540 --> 22:00.000
STARISH
Anteroom

22:00.930 --> 22:02.430
It's finally our turn.

22:02.430 --> 22:04.230
Is everyone ready?

22:04.870 --> 22:06.300
I'm itching to sing.

22:06.730 --> 22:09.040
Let's deliver our song to everyone out there.

22:09.530 --> 22:12.390
I can't confine this feeling, anymore.

22:12.390 --> 22:15.840
We've been teased enough already.

22:15.840 --> 22:19.940
All that's left is to give it all we've got.

22:20.380 --> 22:21.840
Let's go all out.

22:22.790 --> 22:24.150
Here we go.

22:24.150 --> 22:25.900
STARISH!

22:26.210 --> 22:27.030
Fight!

24:06.400 --> 24:08.960
It's all for the angels.

24:08.960 --> 24:10.150
Uta Pri!
